          "command": "s",
          "response": "\nOutside The Theatre\nThe neighbourhood outside the theatre has deteriorated steadily over the last \nthree decades, to the state of a slum (not that you would ever use that word, \nof course). Now a slight mist covers the litter-strewn streets. The street \nheads east and west into the murky twilight.\n\nYour car is parked outside here.\n\nYou can see Rienhart's car disappear into the distance.\n\nWhat now?\n> ",
