          "command": "",
          "response": "\nThe Jewel of Knowledge\nCopyright (c) 1999, Francesco Bova\nRelease 2/ Serial Number 990710/ Inform v6.15 / LIB 6/7\nType 'info' for credits and general comments\nType 'bypass' to skip the intro if you replay the game.\n\n\nRocky Plateau, Sixth Layer\nThe starting point for the final leg of any campaign's pursuit of the Jewel of \nKnowledge. The rocky terrain is surprisingly cool considering how far beneath \nthe Earth's surface you've traveled. Loose lava rocks lie scattered around the \narea and a gaping hole opens up in the ceiling about 10 meters above you. You \ncan travel west and northeast into open areas or north into a gaping lava tube. \nA cool breeze flows from the west to the northeast.\n\nJacob's body lies here, crushed and disfigured.\n\n>",
