          "response": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                                   Welcome to\n\n\n                           E       U       I       N\n                       D       L       S       O       S\n\n\n                           [Press any key to begin.]\n\n\n\n\n                                             Human kind\n                          Cannot bear very much reality.\n\n                      -- T.S. Eliot, Burnt Norton (1936)\n",
